Praying when your god is angry, only makes your god angrier.
Don't do that until your god is "mollified".  

You can mollify your god only by sacrificing corpses of Sufficiently
Nasty Monsters.  You *can* convert altars when your god is angry (as
opposed to when your alignment is negative), but you're unlikely to see
any Sufficiently Nasty Monsters for a long time.

Update: if I understand correctly, you can also mollify your god by 
sacrificing a former pet on a cross-aligned altar!  (Or, a unicorn of 
the same alignment as the altar.)  You won't get the message about 
mollification; you'll have to do it as many times as you prayed.
There's an alignment penalty for this, so kill a few monsters before you 
pray. 

The wand-zapping is not a ridiculous idea.

My advice is find fountains and dip the blindfold in them.  Eventually 
it will uncurse this way.  Watch out for snakes, nymphs, and water 
demons though.  Once you can see, you can start looking for holy water, 
wolfsbane, an amulet of unchanging, or a ring of polymorph control.

